    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιφ-ύσσω</span></b>  (redupl. form from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦ,</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦσα</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow, snort,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				180
			</span></i> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιφύζειν</span></b> 
			v.l. ap. Sch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφύρου μέγα ποιφύξαντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					135
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδικὰ ποιφυξεῖς,</span> title
			of mime by <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.324f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>blow up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				198
			</span></i>; <i>puff out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.215
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Anyt.
			</span></i>).</div>
